# Raw generator output. A Gemini PNG is 5-6 MB; the whole set is ~190 MB, which
# GitHub refuses on upload and which would sit in the repo's history forever.
# Only the processed result belongs in git: after chroma-key, trim and downscale
# the same art lands in public/assets/painted/ at a couple of hundred KB apiece.
art-in/*
!art-in/README.md
